WEBVTT

00:00.120 --> 00:04.000
The geyser has burst. Who do you call?

00:04.240 --> 00:08.160
One message to Home Assist. No chasing quotes, no guesswork.

00:08.616 --> 00:13.496
We send a veteran technician, contracted to us, working to our price list.

00:13.771 --> 00:17.691
He arrives with your job on his phone — registered and checked by us.

00:17.932 --> 00:22.812
Water off, new geyser in, certificate logged, price set up front.

00:22.892 --> 00:26.812
At the end of the day: hot water, and one point of contact.

00:26.892 --> 00:30.812
Home Assist. Technicians of the future, for homes of the future.
